# Version trees

1. `v1/paper/main.tex` is the frozen +1 paper. Edit it only for errata or
   the Gao / arXiv front matter. Do not add sequel theorems there.
2. New results, attacks, and conjecture work go in `v2/paper/main.tex` and
   `v2/notes/`. The six named conjectures (Q, config-split, residual-moment,
   factor-moment, factor-rate, long-step) stay conjectures until a proof in
   that v2 file supports a theorem.
3. Do not retry attacks blocked in v1.0: hybrid-to-Q, binomial PGF without
   pairwise, leftover-free quadratic PGF, Bernoulli residual as BIM residual,
   config-model second moment at half degree, unsigned Gao main term as a
   signed L^3/n rate, Chebyshev on the binomial-host subgraph count N,
   signed Gao after a matching host as a path past n^{1/3}.
4. Run `python scripts/approach_screen.py` from the repo root before expanding
   an approach. Append Wolfram checks for v2 identities to
   `v2/notes/wolfram-checks.md`.
